{"id": "EUVD-2026-76467", "enisaUuid": "6be2a200-e208-3fc0-ab0b-9aebe90c6a22", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmodule: validate string table section types\n\nIn elf_validity_cache_sechdrs, section sizes and offsets are validated,\nunless the section type is SHT_NULL or SHT_NOBITS.\n\nLater, elf_validity_cache_secstrings and elf_validity_cache_index_str\naccess the section name table (.shstrtab) and symbol string table\n(.strtab) headers without first ensuring that their types are\nSHT_STRTAB. If a section type is SHT_NULL or SHT_NOBITS, sh_offset has\nnot been validated and may reference out-of-bounds memory when\ndereferenced in elf_validity_cache_secstrings or\nelf_validity_cache_strtab.\n\nValidate that both string section headers are of type SHT_STRTAB before\ncaching them.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:44:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:48:49", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/50d0aa7d25ba4bc3606f150cd69755068e79f97f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e4496dda2c6d0acf7ba5fbce14a2723a8935ceee", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9a5ff45689329835f874cefe5174e577d141d423"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89556", "GHSA-whm7-hr5x-2m9w"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "29127105-4196-33f2-9ce9-de4038ef7a6b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "392181e4-14db-3554-8c51-70c963970a1c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c92aab819d56d51631f0484ed7af11d9d8ff4cb0 <e4496dda2c6d0acf7ba5fbce14a2723a8935ceee"}, {"id": "5b8a9f06-1a8f-3eb5-9088-338ee0a7f44b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c92aab819d56d51631f0484ed7af11d9d8ff4cb0 <50d0aa7d25ba4bc3606f150cd69755068e79f97f"}, {"id": "7fa96786-7a68-3b31-9262-009de8d76c44", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "afa73846-ac47-3c7c-936a-80338a3d0c06", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "b86a8f93-7b7e-3d56-8f69-4baf35c3adf5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13"}, {"id": "d7650bd3-62c7-3cdf-bf86-0336a98ae0c3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c92aab819d56d51631f0484ed7af11d9d8ff4cb0 <9a5ff45689329835f874cefe5174e577d141d423"}, {"id": "de0cadf3-a41b-30d4-939b-6b2129a1c01c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "43f8052a-2dd0-3ef8-a86c-bc68ff19f3ba", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}